WEBVTT

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:02.639
Earthlings are important, too. Just

00:00:02.639 --> 00:00:04.160
because we don't understand them doesn't

00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:09.480
mean that we have to hurt them, kidnap

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:13.759
them. Earthlings are just like us. We

00:00:13.759 --> 00:00:15.000
just need them

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.840
to learn our ways. We don't have to hurt

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:20.840
them. So,

00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:25.840
please let them go.
